{
  "date_key": "2026-10-19",
  "date_cn": "2026年10月19日",
  "day_cn": "周一",
  "english": "<div style=\"background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #c7dcff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0d47a1;margin-bottom:8px\">🎧 双人地道对话发音</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#566;margin-bottom:9px\">A 男声 · B 女声 · 自然语速</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" style=\"width:100%\"><source src=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-10-19-dialogue.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-10-19-dialogue.wav\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">▶ 播放或下载今日对话音频</a></div></div><div style=\"background:#e8f0fe;border-left:4px solid #1a73e8;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:15px\">【今日主题】</strong><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-weight:400;color:#1a73e8\">职场八卦与办公室政治 (Office Drama &amp; Workplace Dynamics)</span></div>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #0d47a1;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#0d47a1;font-size:15px\">【英文原文】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Did you see the latest email from HR? Dave is suddenly &quot;pursuing other opportunities.&quot; I knew some people <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">had it in for</span> him, but this was incredibly fast. I&#x27;m honestly a bit shocked.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Oh, I&#x27;m not surprised at all. Sarah definitely <strong>had her knives out for him</strong> ever since the Q2 marketing fiasco. Honestly, she&#x27;s been trying to <strong>manage him out</strong> for months by intentionally giving him completely unachievable targets.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Really? That&#x27;s crazy. I actually thought they were <strong>in cahoots with</strong> each other on that big client pitch last month. They seemed so chummy in the boardroom.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">That was all just for show. Sarah is absolutely notorious for her <strong>kiss up and kick down</strong> management style. She loves to <strong>ride on someone&#x27;s coattails</strong> when a project unexpectedly succeeds, but the second things <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">go south</span>, she will totally <strong>stitch someone up</strong> to protect her own reputation.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Wow, brutal. So she basically <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">threw him under the bus</span>. But to be fair, Dave wasn’t exactly innocent in all this. I heard from IT that he tried to <strong>pull rank on</strong> the new junior developers to cover up his own coding mistakes.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Exactly. He really thought he could just <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">throw his weight around</span> without consequences. But when Sarah found out about the cover-up, it really <strong>set the cat among the pigeons</strong>. She bypassed his manager and reported him directly to the VP of Operations.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Karma, I guess. Do you know what Dave&#x27;s old team is doing now, though? It&#x27;s absolute <strong>malicious compliance</strong>. They are following every single ridiculous protocol Sarah puts in place to the absolute letter, just to deliberately slow the entire pipeline down.</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Ha! That sounds like a total nightmare for her. With Dave gone, everyone in that department is just starting to <strong>jockey for position</strong> before the big corporate restructure happens next quarter. We&#x27;d better just <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">keep our heads down</span> and stay out of the blast zone.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #1b5e20;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1b5e20;font-size:15px\">【中文翻译】</strong></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：你看到人力资源部发的最新的邮件了吗？Dave突然“去寻求其他发展机会”了。我知道有些人一直（对他怀恨在心），但这发生得也太快了。说实话我有点震惊。（had it in for）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：哦，我一点也不惊讶。自从第二季度的营销惨案之后，Sarah绝对<strong>对他磨刀霍霍（准备抓他把柄整他）</strong>了。老实说，这几个月来她一直故意给他定一些根本完不成的目标，就是为了<strong>用管理手段逼他走人</strong>。（had her knives out for him / manage him out）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：真的假的？太疯狂了。上个月在那个大客户推介会上，我甚至还以为他们俩<strong>暗中勾结（串通一气）</strong>呢。他们在会议室里看起来那么热络。（in cahoots with）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：那全都是逢场作戏。Sarah那<strong>对上溜须拍马、对下打压欺凌</strong>的管理风格可是出了名的臭。当某个项目意外成功时，她最喜欢<strong>蹭别人的顺风车（抢功劳）</strong>，但一旦事情（进展不顺），她绝对会<strong>给别人下套（陷害别人）</strong>来保全自己的名声。（kiss up and kick down / ride on someone&#x27;s coattails / go south / stitch someone up）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：哇，太狠了。所以她基本上就是（让他当了替罪羊）。不过平心而论，Dave在这事里也不无辜。我听IT部门说，他为了掩盖自己写代码的失误，居然试图<strong>用职权压人</strong>，去欺压新来的初级开发员。（threw him under the bus / pull rank on）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：就是啊。他真以为自己可以随便（滥用职权）而不用承担后果。但当Sarah发现他掩盖错误的事时，这可真是<strong>捅了马蜂窝（引起轩然大波）</strong>。她越过了Dave的主管，直接把他举报到了运营副总裁那里。（throw his weight around / set the cat among the pigeons）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：我想这就是报应吧。不过你知道Dave以前的团队现在在干嘛吗？他们在搞彻头彻尾的<strong>恶意服从（按章怠工）</strong>。他们现在对Sarah制定的每一项荒唐规定都严格照做，就是为了故意拖慢整个工作进度。（malicious compliance）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：哈！对她来说听起来像个绝对的噩梦。现在Dave走了，赶在下个季度公司大重组之前，那个部门的所有人都已经开始<strong>明争暗斗以谋取有利位置</strong>了。我们最好还是（保持低调），远离那个是非之地吧。（jockey for position / keep our heads down）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e5f5;border-left:4px solid #4a148c;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#4a148c;font-size:15px\">【本日表达列表】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">01.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">[have one&#x27;s knives out for someone]</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 准备严厉批评某人；对某人磨刀霍霍、伺机攻击</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 常用于职场或政界，指某人或某群体怀有敌意，准备抓住机会攻击或整垮某人。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">02.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">[manage someone out]</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 通过管理手段逼退某人（如故意给差评、设定不可能的任务等）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用（企业英语）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 HR或管理层术语，指不直接解雇，而是让员工日子难过从而主动辞职。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">03.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">[in cahoots with]</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 与...暗中勾结；串通一气</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国通用/全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 指两人或多人在背地里结盟，通常是为了做一些不诚实或排挤他人的事情。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">04.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">[kiss up and kick down]</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 对上级溜须拍马，对下属打压欺凌</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用（职场俚语）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 用来形容那种在老板面前阿谀奉承，但对基层员工却态度恶劣、极其苛刻的势利管理者。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">05.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">[ride on someone&#x27;s coattails]</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 沾某人的光；借别人的成功/努力为自己谋利</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 职场中指某人自己不出力，却利用同事的工作成果来获得表扬或晋升。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">06.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">[stitch someone up]</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 给某人下套；陷害、出卖某人</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国/澳大利亚俚语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 指为了推脱责任或谋取私利，故意编造谎言或设局让别人背黑锅。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">07.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">[pull rank on someone]</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 以权压人；利用自己的高职位迫使他人服从</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 当讲理行不通时，上级直接用自己的职位级别强制下属听命或闭嘴。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">08.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">[set the cat among the pigeons]</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 惹出乱子；引起轩然大波（像把猫放进鸽子群）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国/全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 指某人做了一件事或说了一句话，在原本平静（或看似平静）的人群中引发了极大的恐慌、争议或麻烦。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">09.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">[malicious compliance]</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 恶意服从；按章怠工</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用（网络与职场流行语）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 指员工明明知道上级的命令不合理或会导致糟糕的后果，却仍然一字不差地严格执行，以此作为隐性报复。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">10.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">[jockey for position]</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 明争暗斗以谋取优势/地位</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容在公司重组、升职季或权力真空期，人们为了争夺更好的资源或职位而进行的竞争和运作。</span></td></tr></table>",
  "research": "<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9eef2;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 22px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00838f,#26c6da);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin:-20px -22px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.6px\">🎯 今日研究主线</div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#546e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧭 选题方向：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Transnational curriculum and assessment fairness</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#6a1b9a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧷 对应草稿：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">10.1002/curj.70094</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#1565c0;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🔎 检索主题：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">transnational curriculum language assessment fairness justice multilingual qualification policy</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#8e24aa;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🪄 为什么是它：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">延伸已发表的跨国资格与课程公平研究，优先概念创新和可迁移诊断框架。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">✍️ 今天重点：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">寻找能推进尺度、治理、证据语言与可被命名的不公平之间关系的文章。</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:5px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#555;font-size:13px;padding-left:96px\">（今天没有论文同时通过启发性、主线相关性与质量门槛。宁缺毋滥，明天再看。）</p>\n</div>",
