  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/10/19/2003866204\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">冻结的国防项目不在议程之列</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Frozen defense items not on agenda</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">此新闻可能涉及某国或国际组织就国防开支或军事援助进行的讨论，强调某些被冻结的项目并未被纳入当前议程，这或将影响区域安全格局或国际军事合作走向。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3371331/falling-crucifix-kills-priest-during-live-streamed-mass-ecuador?utm_source=rss_feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">厄瓜多尔直播弥撒期间，坠落的十字架致一名牧师身亡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Falling crucifix kills priest during live-streamed mass in Ecuador</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在厄瓜多尔的一场直播弥撒中，一个巨大的十字架意外坠落，导致正在主持仪式的牧师当场死亡。这起悲剧事件引发了公众对教堂安全规范和公共活动安全的关注，令人震惊。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://rfa.org/english/china/2026/09/29/taiwan-philippines-trade-office/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">分析人士：中国施压加速菲律宾与台湾关系发展</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China pressure accelerates Philippines-Taiwan ties, analysts say</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">分析人士指出，中国大陆对菲律宾施加的压力，反而促使菲律宾与台湾之间的关系加速发展。这反映了地区地缘政治的复杂性，以及外部压力可能带来的意想不到的区域关系重塑。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">自由亚洲电台</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c65yn877dkk0o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">军情五处警告后，英国大学要求员工审查与中国的部分合作关系</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">UK university asks staff to review some partnerships with China after MI5 warning</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国军情五处（MI5）发出警告后，一所英国大学要求其教职员工审查与中国的部分合作关系。此举表明英国对国家安全和知识产权保护的日益重视，可能影响中英学术交流。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/10/08/in-china-people-get-unusually-long-public-holidays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国民众迎来超长公共假期</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">In China, people get unusually long public holidays</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国民众今年将迎来不同寻常的超长公共假期，这通常是为了刺激消费和促进国内旅游。此举可能对中国经济和社会生活产生广泛影响，值得关注其长期效应。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/books/2026/10/poem-j-mae-barizo-catalog/689060/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">《错位物品目录》</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Catalog of Misplaced Things</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">这可能是一本关于失物招领、物品错位或对物品归属权进行探讨的书籍或文章目录，其关注点可能在于物品与主人之间的关系、所有权的复杂性或文化意义。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/16/news-quiz-houthi-saudi-strikes-trump-commercials-india-protests/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">天下万象</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">What in the World?</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">这是一个宽泛的栏目名称，通常用于概览国际重大新闻和热点事件，涵盖政治、经济、社会文化等多个领域，旨在为读者提供全球视野下的多元信息，值得关注其具体内容更新。（中立视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/10/18/zelensky-witkoff-kushner-ukraine-russia-crisis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美乌危机背景下，泽连斯基与维特科夫、库什纳对话</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Zelensky speaks to Witkoff, Kushner amid U.S.-Ukraine crisis</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在俄乌冲突持续、美乌关系复杂之际，乌克兰总统泽连斯基与美国地产商维特科夫及前总统顾问库什纳进行对话，引发外界对其潜在合作内容和美国政商界对乌克兰支持态度的关注。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/10/18/nx-s1-6007382/ukraine-us-starshield-starlink-what-to-know-trump\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">乌克兰与美国就“星盾”系统产生分歧：你需要了解的背景</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Ukraine and the U.S. are at odds over Starshield. Here&#x27;s what to know</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">乌克兰与美国在马斯克的“星盾”卫星通信系统使用问题上出现争议，这不仅关乎战时关键通信技术，也反映了盟友间在高科技军事援助和控制权上的潜在摩擦，其解决方式将影响未来合作。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.dw.com/en/france-young-voters-blase-about-glucksmann-s-socialists/a-79684159?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">法国：年轻选民对格鲁克斯曼的社会党表现冷淡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">France: Young voters blase about Glucksmann&#x27;s Socialists</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">法国年轻一代选民对拉斐尔·格鲁克斯曼领导的社会党缺乏热情，这揭示了法国传统左翼政党在吸引年轻选民方面面临的挑战，以及欧洲政治版图可能出现的代际变动。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">DW(德国,中立)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261018-macron-says-nothing-justifies-violence-in-protests-during-address-to-nation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">马克龙全国讲话称“没有任何理由”为抗议活动中的暴力行为辩护</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">🔴 Macron says &#x27;nothing justifies&#x27; violence in protests during address to nation</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">法国总统马克龙在全国讲话中严厉谴责抗议活动中的暴力行径，强调其缺乏正当性。此番表态旨在平息国内动荡，维护社会秩序，但也可能引发关于言论自由和国家权力界限的进一步讨论。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">法国24(法国)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/18/macron-vows-to-hold-those-who-sought-to-bring-down-the-republic-accountable-after-riots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">骚乱过后，马克龙誓言追究那些试图“颠覆共和国”者的责任</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Macron vows to hold those who sought to “bring down the Republic” accountable after riots</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在法国近期骚乱之后，总统马克龙承诺将严惩那些被认为企图“颠覆共和国”的肇事者。此举表明法国政府将采取强硬立场维护国家稳定，但同时也可能引发对其行动合法性和尺度的争议。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">欧洲新闻台(泛欧)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw240zl08dm5o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">法国骚乱后马克龙呼吁“恢复平静和秩序”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Macron calls for &#x27;calm and order&#x27; after riots across France</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">法国总统埃马纽埃尔·马克龙在全国性骚乱持续数日后，公开呼吁民众保持冷静并恢复社会秩序。此次骚乱因一名青少年被警察枪杀而引发，凸显了法国社会内部的紧张关系和深层问题。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC世界</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://english.elpais.com/usa/2026-10-18/water-is-for-people-voters-across-party-lines-push-back-against-data-centers-ahead-of-the-midterms.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">“水是给人用的！”：美国选民在中期选举前反对数据中心建设</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">‘Water is for people!’: Voters across party lines push back against data centers ahead of the midterms</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在美国中期选举临近之际，两党选民联合起来反对在当地建设新的数据中心。他们主要关注数据中心对水资源的巨大消耗，认为这威胁到社区的日常用水需求，成为地方政治议题。（美国主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">西班牙El País</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌏 亚太视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.japantimes.co.jp/news/2026/10/18/japan/politics/takaichis-support-rate-falls/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">共同社报道：高市早苗支持率跌破50%，创就任以来新低</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Takaichi’s support rate falls below 50%, lowest since taking office, Kyodo reports</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">据共同社报道，日本经济安全保障担当大臣高市早苗的支持率已降至50%以下，达到其上任以来的最低点。这反映了公众对其政策或表现的满意度下降，可能对其政治前景产生影响。（日本主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-10-19/epl-diego-gomez-goal-halfway-line-david-beckham-brighton-win/107281698\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">布莱顿边锋远射破门，勾起球迷对贝克汉姆的经典回忆</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Brighton winger&#x27;s long-range goal conjures decades-old memories of Beckham</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在近日一场足球比赛中，布莱顿队的一名边锋球员打入一记精彩的远距离进球，其精准度和力量感让许多球迷联想起英格兰传奇球星大卫·贝克汉姆的经典时刻，引发了对昔日辉煌的怀旧。（体育娱乐）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/oil-tanker-on-fire-after-hitting-mine-in-hormuz-irans-guards/article71596177.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">伊朗卫队：油轮在霍尔木兹海峡触雷起火</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Oil tanker on fire after hitting mine in Hormuz: Iran&#x27;s Guards</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">伊朗革命卫队报告称，一艘油轮在具有战略意义的霍尔木兹海峡触及水雷后起火。这一事件可能对全球石油供应和地区安全局势造成影响，并引发对航运安全的担忧。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2326173/inquirer-report-on-ph-debt-wins-cmma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">《问询者报》关于菲律宾债务的报道荣获CMMA奖</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Inquirer report on PH debt wins CMMA</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">《菲律宾问询者报》因其关于菲律宾国家债务的深度报道而获得了天主教大众传媒奖（CMMA）。该奖项肯定了媒体在揭示重要公共议题方面的卓越新闻工作，提高了公众对国家财政状况的认识。（媒体行业）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">菲律宾每日问询者</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/19/morning-mail-monday-ntwnfb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">晨报：西澳青少年拘留中心被指控性侵；右翼游说团体的“离奇”运动；以及日本的探月任务</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Morning Mail: Rape alleged in WA youth detention; rightwing lobby’s ‘bizarre’ campaign; and Japan’s moon mission</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">澳大利亚今日晨报关注西澳青少年拘留中心涉嫌性侵指控的最新进展，同时报道了右翼游说团体一项引发争议的“离奇”运动，以及日本备受瞩目的探月任务，为读者提供多方面新闻概览。（澳大利亚主流媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲卫报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/10/19/the-grassroots-housing-ideas-escaping-notice/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">被忽视的草根住房解决方案</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The grassroots housing ideas escaping notice</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">本文探讨了那些在地方层面涌现、却常被主流政策制定者忽视的草根住房倡议和创新理念。文章呼吁关注这些自下而上的解决方案，它们可能为缓解住房危机提供新思路和可行路径。（独立视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/regional/2014451/the-young-wellingtonian-finding-inventive-ways-to-get-employed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">惠灵顿年轻人如何创新性地寻找就业机会</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The young Wellingtonian finding inventive ways to get employed</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰惠灵顿一名年轻人在当前竞争激烈的就业市场中，通过一系列富有创意和独特的方法成功求职。这篇文章分享了他的经验与策略，为面临就业压力的年轻人提供启发和借鉴。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/sport/361046316/australia-beat-white-ferns-three-wickets-first-twenty20-international\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">突破性表现未能扭转乾坤，澳大利亚T20首战击败白蕨队</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Breakthrough innings in vain as Australia win first T20 against White Ferns</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在澳大利亚与新西兰白蕨队的T20系列赛首战中，尽管新西兰队员有突破性的个人表现，澳大利亚队最终仍取得胜利。本场比赛为系列赛奠定基调，备受板球迷关注。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c962ydpmjm3zo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">欧洲外交官在约旦河西岸遭到以色列定居者袭击</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">European diplomats attacked by Israeli settlers in West Bank</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">多名欧洲外交官在约旦河西岸地区执行任务时，遭遇以色列定居者的暴力袭击，引发国际社会对该地区安全局势和定居者行为的广泛关注与谴责。此次事件可能加剧地区紧张局势。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3kgqjkzw29wo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">三名男子因在墨西哥谋杀澳大利亚和美国冲浪者各被判158年监禁</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Three men jailed for 158 years each for murdering Australian and US surfers in Mexico</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">三名涉案男子因在墨西哥残忍杀害一名澳大利亚冲浪者和一名美国冲浪者，被当地法院判处每人158年监禁。此案判决体现了对跨国犯罪的严惩，也为受害者家属带来迟来的正义。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/18/albania-protests-supreme-court-fire?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">阿尔巴尼亚最高法院陷火海，反政府示威进入第五天</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Fire engulfs Albania’s Supreme Court as protests enter fifth day</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在阿尔巴尼亚，民众因对政府腐败和生活成本上涨的不满，发起的反政府示威已持续五天。抗议活动升级，并引发最高法院大火，凸显该国政治和社会局势的紧张与动荡。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
